// The four sites are four independent modules. This file exists only so that
// `go build ./...`, `go vet ./...` and `go test ./...` still work from the
// repo root, and so an editor opening the monorepo resolves all four at once.
//
// Nothing depends on it. Each site builds on its own with `go build` from its
// own directory, and its Docker build context is that directory alone, which
// is the whole point of the split: a site can be moved to its own repository
// by copying the folder, with no parent module to bring along.
go 1.27.0

use (
	./sites/analytics.bythewood.me
	./sites/blog.bythewood.me
	./sites/isaacbythewood.com
	./sites/status.bythewood.me
)
